      "created_at": "2022-05-24T16:46:18.078Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I haven’t gotten around to listening to an episode since I started my new job, but the Inversiverse Galactra will definitely bring me back.  I’m extremely interested in where that will go.</p>\n<p>And of course, reinventing a character is pure gold.  I could literally spend a year doing that once a week and not run out of material.  It’s incredibly fertile creative ground.  So that episode will also be a priority for me.</p>",
