      "created_at": "2022-05-24T19:16:45.872Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I figured as much, just throwing the other thing out there. So basically I’m envisioning an overzealous Girl Scout who bends over backwards to help people!</p>\n<p>Come to think of it, have we heard anything before about her likely nemesis, evil Captain Cosmic? Against all classic sci-fi convention, the “bad” version does <strong>not</strong> have a beard!</p>",
